/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Build artifacts
*.plugin/
/dist/
# Pre-computed filter previews are a build artifact: `make previews`
# regenerates them (with a per-filter up-to-date check) into previews/,
# and the bundle build copies them into the .plugin Resources. They are
# large (~200MB) and reproducible, so they are NOT committed. A fresh
# clone has none until `make previews` runs; the picker shows a
# "No preview available" placeholder for any that are absent.
/previews/
# NB: GmicFilter.rsrc is NOT in this list. We commit it intentionally
# so CI (which has no Adobe Photoshop SDK) can still build the bundle.
# The Makefile re-runs Rez whenever the SDK is available; otherwise it
# falls back to the committed copy. See Makefile: `pipl` target.

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Local config that should not be committed
.env
.env.*
# .env.local in particular: per-developer signing/notarisation config used
# by `make release` (the Developer ID Application certificate name and the
# notarytool keychain-profile name). Lives only on the signer's machine.
# See release/notarisation/SIGNING.md.
.worktrees
